ump  a slightly different aspect on a similar  story within the same universe because  there is nothing to say that within what  we've seen of balsa galactic or ronaldi  moore's battlestar galactica that more  humans didn't survive somewhere else  but we cannot have the same series again  we cannot have another battle star with  another bunch of refugees trying to  escape the cylons now there are other  battle stars we know about the pegasus  and things like this but that's been  done they need to do something different  so just maybe  this is a way they could go  so guys get into the comments tell me  what you think is this a theory that has  just come at the top of my head and is  utter madness or is it something that  you'd actually like to see  or is there another idea that you've got  that you would love to see get in the  comments and tell me exactly what you  think if you are new to the channel  please like subscribe hit that bell  notification thumbs up thumbs down helps  nobody and if you want to become a fully  fledged sidetracker you can consider  hitting that join button it really  supports the channel  as always please guys stay safe i'll see  you soon  [Music]  you

